Package: plotly.express
Type: Package
Title: Quick Interactive Figures with 'plotly.js'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Matthew", "Summersgill", email = "matthew.summersgill@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-2955-5543")),
    person("Nicolas", "Kruchten", role = "ctb",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8416-789X", "'plotly.py' express module")),
    person("Plotly Technologies Inc.", role = "cph",
           comment = "Port of 'plotly.py' express module; datasets from 'plotly.py'")
  )
Description: High-level functions that make a complete interactive figure from
    a data frame in one call (scatter, line, bar, histogram, box, map, polar,
    3D, hierarchy and other charts), with faceting, marginal plots,
    trendlines, animation and colour mapping. A port of the 'express' module
    of the 'plotly' Python package, built on the 'plotly.core' package.
